Subject: [PATCH] 8 general purpose PWM outputs instead of 4 (pro-style)

GPPWM_CHANNELS goes from 4 to 8, with TunerStudio dialogs, tables, menu entries and
gauges for channels 5 to 8. Live data gppwmOutput/XAxis/YAxis grow to 8.

